# Template engine

Place prompt template logic under `lib/core/` (e.g. `core/utils/prompt_template.dart`).

- **No** `package:flutter` imports in parser modules.
- Syntax: `{{name}}` where `name` is `[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*`.
- Provide at least:
  - `extractVariables(String template)` — unique names, stable first-seen order
  - `substitute(String template, Map<String, String> values)` — document empty/missing key behavior in tests
- Cover edge cases in unit tests (repeat vars, no vars, empty string).
